WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:35.860
I'm Kurata Sana, first year Junior High School student.

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:37.860
Manager Rei-kun.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.950
Brad, who looks a lot like a Japanese friend.

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:44.080
Broadway's dance instructor, Michelle Hamilton.

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:47.460
Her husband is the king producer, Gary Hamilton.

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:49.880
Their only daughter, Sicil.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.960
Naozumi's mother who appeared out of nowhere, Mizukuchi Yuko.

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:55.470
There's something suspicious.

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:57.470
The mysterious white bat, "Babbit"!

00:01:57.470 --> 00:02:01.470
Those kind of men...

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:05.480
My best friend in New York, Naozumi-kun.

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:09.060
Are you Gary Hamilton?

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:10.560
Yes. Who are you?

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:14.150
Only you can help, Hamilton-san.

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:16.320
Please stop Yuko.

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:17.950
Yuko?

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.660
Yuko Mizukuchi.

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:22.280
Naozumi Kamura is currently at her house.

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:23.280
What?

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:28.370
Mother's Conspiracy

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:40.640
Hi!

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:41.890
Thanks for coming!

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:43.220
What's up?

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:47.600
I can't say that I have fully recovered, but I am feeling a lot better.

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:49.640
Where's Yuko?

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:51.770
She went out just now to buy something.

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:53.560
At noon, she's going to make pizza.

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:55.570
Ah, I'll make some red tea.

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:06.450
I think I... was always trying to be strong...

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:14.670
I didn't want to know my past and also didn't want others to know.

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:21.800
I like the current me. I think it's enough.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:29.270
But, when we're acting in a drama, don't we sometimes act as a family member?

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:32.770
I thought of everyone at the
"Kamura School" as my family...

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:35.190
...so I tried to act with that kind of feeling.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:39.070
But it never felt right.
I always felt a little lonely.

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:44.910
I always wondered...

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:51.410
...what kind of people my real parents would be.

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:54.790
I guess...

00:03:54.790 --> 00:04:03.050
I guess I just really wanted to see my parents.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:10.350
I finally met my mother.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:13.230
Seeing her was so wonderful.

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.190
Oh! She's back!

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:20.860
Seeing her was so wonderful.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.360
Welcome back!

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:24.860
He said seeing her was so wonderful.

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:46.050
Why is Hamilton here?

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:48.850
Can I come in for a while?

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:51.470
Is something wrong?

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:53.980
Where is Yuko?

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:55.350
Out.

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:57.020
Is that so?

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:58.860
Sorry for my interruption.

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:03.280
Are those two father and son?

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:04.780
- Shut up.
- Right.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:14.160
Naozumi.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:16.870
I admire your talents.

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:20.380
As well as Sana's, who is over there.

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:24.550
Kurata Sana, 12 years old.

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:30.970
I am confident that this performance will be a success.

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:37.770
This musical need the two of you.
It will become a big topic of conversation.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:45.570
I hope you can participate at the rehearsals.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:19.350
Gary.

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:22.940
Nao!

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:29.240
High five!

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:32.200
I will always be your friend.

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:34.160
Thank you.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:44.250
Close the door softly!

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:44.550
This mother's expression is very fierce right now.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:49.050
I guess I have to go to rehearsals alone today as well.

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:51.510
Michelle will have to fix me up again.

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:52.930
Sorry, Sana-chan.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:55.640
Don't worry about it.

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:59.350
Gary came over,
what did he say to you?

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:00.770
Did he say anything to you?

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.980
Naozumi, did he say anything dreadful?

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:04.360
No.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:09.780
You can't, Naozumi, don't leave... Don't leave me all alone.

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:16.240
I'll be here... by mother's side... always.

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:19.830
<i>Naozumi's heart is already mine.</i>

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:26.300
Really?

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:29.970
What do you think you're doing, coming here all by yourself?

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:33.050
What can I say, but my partner's down with a fever.

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.760
Lacking the acting spirit?

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:36.850
You can go home today.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:39.140
Michelle, wait!

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:41.560
Please look at this.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:45.940
Look, look, me and Naozumi.

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:47.270
Music!

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:03.170
What?

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:05.670
Some pretty good dancing there...

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:08.340
Some really good dancing...

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:13.010
Michelle is mad

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:13.010
Michelle, don't be mad.

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:18.350
What? Please repeat the name.

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:20.270
Someone called Yuko Mizukuchi.

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:23.140
She said if I told you her name, you would see her.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.360
Bring her in.

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:30.070
Please, come in.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:36.370
Long time no see, Gary.

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:41.080
Ever since you scratched me off at the "Pretty Lady" screening until now.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:43.370
About 3 years?

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:46.460
That was a decision made by the whole cast.

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:49.550
Your age didn't fit the category either.

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:52.920
What is it? I have to leave right now.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:58.550
That's right, you're always busy.

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:00.560
You can accomplish anything.

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:02.980
You think there is nothing you can't do.

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:04.850
But there is one thing.

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:08.060
Moving Naozumi's heart.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:11.280
What exactly are you planning?

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:16.410
Donuts, Donuts, let's eat them together, Naozumi-kun!

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:23.750
Ah! You're that guy from last time!

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:30.040
Mister, you're the guy that approached Naozumi-kun last time, right?

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:34.550
Right? Why? Why? Why?

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:39.180
Mister, why did you approach Naozumi-kun last time?

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:42.260
What relationship do you have with Naozumi-kun? What's going on?

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:43.350
This...

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:44.560
This?

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:49.560
I can't tell you right now!
Later! I'm sorry!

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:51.270
Wait!

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.360
She sure knows how to stick to people.

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:57.950
Mister!

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:02.580
Mister, are you alright?

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.080
Naozumi can't stay there.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.620
Didn't you just say it?

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.880
Naozumi must leave Yuko.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.540
Mister, who are you?

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:12.960
Play the leading lady?

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:16.840
Yes. And not those
little performances either.

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:20.340
I mean for Broadway's top shows.

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:25.850
The script, the art, the cast, everything must be five-star quality.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:27.850
This isn't a comedy.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:30.980
I have the skills to make the audience cheer for me like crazy.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:33.070
You just haven't noticed it.

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.780
Isn't the person who hasn't noticed you?

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:38.780
No matter what you say, don't forget...

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:41.660
...Naozumi's heart is with me.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:45.660
Naozumi said that he'll always be by my side.

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:48.370
And he said that he won't act in your musical.

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:51.170
He is already obeying
what I tell him to do.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:55.050
What did you say to Naozumi?
What did you say to make him obey you?

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:56.760
I only told him the truth.

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:59.760
You and I neglected Naozumi.

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:04.260
I didn't even know Naozumi was born.

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:07.350
Whatever you say now won't change anything.

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:09.060
So what will it be?

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:11.770
You want Naozumi to be in your musical, right?

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:14.650
I can persuade him.

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:19.950
You are using Naozumi, your own son, as a bargaining chip?

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:23.570
I want to stand on a stage. I want to receive cheers from the audience.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:29.460
If I fulfill all your requests...

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:33.670
...will you promise me that you will never go near Naozumi again?

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:35.920
Okay.

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:49.640
I did it, I finally did it!

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:53.270
From now on, I'll be a star! Yes, a star!

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:58.570
Taxi!

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:07.990
Stupid woman.

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:13.290
Stupid woman - by Gary

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:10.960
Woman stupid. Woman stupid.

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:13.540
It's not the time to hear it reversed.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:16.170
No way, how can it be?

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.250
It's true.

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:22.050
Yuko only wanted to use Naozumi.

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:25.840
But isn't Yuko Naozumi-kun's birth mother?

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.970
Real mothers don't do that!

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:29.850
She doesn't care.

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:33.350
Yuko only wants to stand on stage and be praised.

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:45.990
{parte b}

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:48.780
Babbit's number song

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:48.950
Because the audience requested it again.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:51.870
1, 2, 1-2-3, 1.

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:54.670
One bunch, one bunch, and yet another bunch...

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:58.040
Babbit's entire family, no problems!

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:00.750
One bunch, one bunch, and yet another bunch...

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.840
Babbit's entire family, no problems!

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:06.840
1, 2, 1-2-3, 2.

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:09.850
Want to spit at someone but can't do it...

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:12.850
... a serious scene is the most troublesome scene.

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:15.560
Want to spit at someone but can't do it...

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:18.770
... a serious scene is the most troublesome scene.

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:21.860
1, 2, 1-2-3, 3.

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:24.860
Sri Lanka is next to India...

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:27.660
... a place where red tea is popular.

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:30.950
Sri Lanka is next to India...

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:34.160
... a place where red tea is popular.

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:36.960
To be continued next time.

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:42.380
Wait... a minute!
As if I'll believe this!

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:45.090
Mister, who are you really?

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:47.840
Me?

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.260
I am...

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:54.730
Who am I?

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:58.770
You are him!

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:58.650
He wanted to say "Yuko's lover" but didn't have the guts.

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:05.280
I once tried to stop Yuko, but Yuko didn't listen to me.

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:08.570
I wanted to tell Naozumi and made contact with him many times...

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:10.370
...but someone would interrupt every time.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:12.370
I interrupted once.

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:14.950
I tried asking Gary Hamilton...

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:17.870
...but there seems to be something wrong between those two...

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:18.750
Yuko...

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:22.380
I've come this far,
but we can still make it now.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.960
That is what I think, anyway.

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:26.010
No courage at all.

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:27.260
Coward.

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:34.260
You... are whom?

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:37.270
You don't know!

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:38.980
Me...?

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:42.060
Kurata Sana, 12 years old. First year Junior High School Student.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:45.070
You don't have to make a gesture when you say your name.

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:47.320
Are you Naozumi's girlfriend?

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:48.950
It seems I can only count on you.

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:49.780
Huh?

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:52.570
Can you please tell Naozumi the truth?

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:57.660
And I hope you can stop Yuko's scheme.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:01.040
And also, and also...

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:06.960
If you can talk her into letting me back in the house, I will be very lucky.

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:13.760
I am here. Contact me if anything happens.

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:17.850
Don't order pizza. The store's pizza tastes very bad.

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:21.440
Don't drive a car in the park!

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:27.690
If that was true. If...

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:31.160
Then again, can it...

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:33.160
Can it, can it, can it be...

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:34.870
Can it be he is a born trickster?

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:40.830
Can it be, be careful of candles in case...

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:43.000
Can it be...

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.380
These kind of things are unpredictable.

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:53.470
No way... it can't be like that.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:55.680
That's what I think, anyway.

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:01.350
There isn't any "forensic"
to what that man said.

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:02.350
It's "evidence".

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:04.480
When confused...

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:05.980
When confused?

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:06.940
Just wait and see.

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:08.780
Oy, oy.

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:11.860
What is this?

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:18.790
I respect your talent.

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:21.290
I hope you can participate
at the rehearsals.

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:33.470
Are you okay?
Mother, are you okay?

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:37.760
Naozumi... good boy...

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:39.010
What happened?

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:40.970
You should also be very happy.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:44.350
The musical I will star in
has been decided.

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:46.860
Ah! The one you mentioned last time?

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:51.150
There will be a party tonight, call everyone to celebrate!

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:55.360
Hello Sally, how are you?

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:59.160
I am going to have a party right now, please ask everyone to come.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:01.410
I've decided to star in a musical.

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:04.670
Really, I finally have the chance.

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:06.880
English word of the day...

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:09.840
Ecstasy.

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:16.220
No, no, no, no... yes, yes, yes...
no, no, no, no...

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:19.560
Miss...?

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:20.970
Bernie, tea.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:23.060
It's not tea, kid?

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:25.480
Here, have some water.

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:30.440
Do you want anything?

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:33.070
No, it's alright, I'm too full.

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:41.660
Eating too many donuts will make you fat.

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:41.370
Watch out for weight gain!

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.160
What? Already decided.

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:48.540
You'll also attend the party, right?
Bring lots of pizzas.

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:58.090
That woman has finally done it.

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:00.850
Manager, large order.

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:02.260
What?

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:06.350
Who's this customer who still wants to eat our store's pizza?

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:09.480
The stupid woman I'm in love with.

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:14.860
Okay, I will go make the worst tasting pizzas.

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:17.860
Pizza pie, pizza pie, pie...

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:23.580
- Congratulations, Yuko.
- Thank you.

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:26.290
That's some surprisingly good news.

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:30.960
I've always thought you would be a successful person.

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:33.380
If you put it that way, I'm very happy.

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:39.550
Where did this loony come from?

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:42.680
A woman with no talent like her.

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:46.060
Doesn't matter, they're all similar people.

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:50.150
Really?

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:59.910
I am Rei-kun, I am very free. Nothing to do, so I am preparing dinner.

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:04.330
Yohoo, yohoo... tasty curry rice.

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:14.960
Right now, Naozumi-kun has a mountain pile of troubles that he has to deal with.

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:18.550
If it still doesn't work out, he'll still have us, right?

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:24.260
He still has a fever,
he is at Yuko's house.

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:33.650
I am Rei-kun, I am very free.
He's actually a very good manager,

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:37.610
but has nothing to do in New York.

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:45.660
Too late.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:50.460
Yuko's scheme worked.

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:56.550
The only thing we can do now is heal the people they've hurt.

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:01.220
The little guy is under your care now.

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:08.350
It was real.... It was real....

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:12.980
I am so stupid!

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:23.860
What do you mean you don't believe it?

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:26.950
I don't believe it means I don't believe it.

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:29.580
Even the crew is five-star?

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:34.960
Someone like you chosen as the leading lady in a five-star quality musical?

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:38.380
I don't think anyone will believe that.

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:42.050
What do you mean by someone like you?

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:45.340
A woman with no talent and no skills.

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:51.600
That would be you, right?

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:56.020
There is someone who acknowledges my skills and talent

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:58.520
and is paying money for me to perform.

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:02.360
Who would that be?
I really want to know.

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:13.660
But... I promised I wouldn't tell.

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:15.370
Everyone wants to know, right?

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:19.670
